  clock: 3  # 1518
  nonce: '1518'  # 1518
  message: "Fixed in PR #3006. Added scan_content_cached(content, cache_dir, max_entries=8) which keys gitleaks output by sha256 of the sketch content and stores findings in <cache_dir>/secret_scan_cache.json. The cache_dir is the per-state results directory (_get_results_cache_dir), so source-file changes rotate the directory and invalidate the cache automatically without separate logic. cmd_sketch wired to call the cached version. Verified on alertmanager: warm sketch ~7s vs prior ~16s, matching the --no-secret-scan baseline. All 8577 tests pass at 100% coverage."  # 1518
